{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>I will not destroy it for the sake of the twenty... for the sake of the ten.</b> For if three of them were destroyed, the remaining two would not escape entirely from being harmed in some way by the destruction of their neighbors, as the Sages said (Berakhot 58a): When Babylon was cursed, its neighbors were cursed along with it."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:30:41.817954982Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}